LINES = [{'id': 'rule', 'text': 'In this town, wish for something out loud and poof, it appears. But something of yours vanishes.'}, {'id': 'bike', 'text': "I traded my brand new bike for one cupcake. It wasn't even chocolate."}, {'id': 'pizza', 'text': 'Leo wished for a giant pizza. His backpack vanished, homework and all. He called it a win.'}, {'id': 'gran', 'text': 'My gran wished for a cake. Poof, cake. Poof, her best dress. Now she bakes in pajamas.'}, {'id': 'rex', 'text': "Then there's Rex, the richest man in town. His trick? One thousand gum wrappers in his pockets."}, {'id': 'trick', 'text': 'Every wish only costs him one wrapper. Gold bars, poof. Trophy, poof. Rex never loses anything.'}, {'id': 'steal', 'text': "Then he wished for other people's stuff. Leo's pizza. Gran's cake. Even my half-eaten cupcake."}, {'id': 'empty', 'text': "Then the wrappers ran out. Rex didn't notice. He yelled, I wish for a golden throne!"}, {'id': 'suit', 'text': 'Poof, throne. And poof, his fancy suit vanished. The richest man in town, in pajamas.'}, {'id': 'chaos', 'text': 'He panicked and kept wishing. His trophy vanished. His gold vanished. Then he started shrinking!'}, {'id': 'brave', 'text': "Rex was hamster-sized and still wishing. So I marched up and wished out loud: everyone's stuff, go home!"}, {'id': 'refund', 'text': 'Something of mine had to vanish. The magic took my half-eaten cupcake, and gave back my bike!'}, {'id': 'homework', 'text': 'Turns out the magic does refunds. Leo got his pizza back. And his backpack. With his homework.'}, {'id': 'saving', 'text': "Rex is still hamster-sized. He's saving up gum wrappers again. One at a time."}, {'id': 'money', 'text': "And next time I want a cupcake, I'm buying one. With money. Like a normal person."}]
